cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "openair-3-mcp-server-oss: an MCP server bridging AI clients to the R openair package"
abstract: >-
  A Python + R Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that lets AI clients
  (Claude, Cursor, Codex, VS Code, and custom agents) drive the R openair
  package for air quality data analysis and publication-grade charting,
  from raw CSV/Excel/public-network data to deterministic openair output.
